                        <p sytle="line-height:26px;font-size:18px;color:#5e5e5e;">
                            
                            Hello {!Contact.FirstName},<br/>
                            <p>I just want to reach out and ensure you know your policy has expired and if there is anything I can do to help.   
<p>
If you need help activating your new account or accessing your old policies, just let me know.  We can even do a video or telephone together...anytime.
<h2 style="line-height:26px;font-size:18px;color:#5e5e5e;">Policy Renewal Details</h2>
<table>
     <tr>
          <th>Policy</th>
          <th>Underwriter</th>
          <th>Expiration</th>
     </tr>
     <tr>
          <td>{!Policy__c.Name}</td>
          <td>{!Policy__c.Underwriter_picklist__c}</td>
          <td>{!Policy__c.End_Date__c}</td><br/>
</table>
<p><strong>Policy Summary:</strong></p>
<table>
     <tr>
          <th>Year</th>
          <th>Make</th>
          <th>Model</th>
          <th>Stated Value</th>
          <th>Liability</th>

     </tr>
     <tr>
          <th>{!Policy__c.Vehicle_Year__c}</th>
          <th>{!Policy__c.Vehicle_Make__c}</th>
          <th>{!Policy__c.Vehicle_Model__c}</th>
          <th>{!Policy__c.Vehicle_Value__c}</th>
          <th>{!Policy__c.Liability__c}</th>

     </tr>
</table>
<br/><br/>

                          <p>For your convenience, you can quickly renew your policy online by clicking the button below.</p><br/>


       <center>                 <a style="background-color:#003a70;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:15px 35px;border-radius:30px;width:max-content;margin:10px 0px;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;display:block;color:#fff;" class="mexemeailbut" href="https://at.mexinsurance.com/s/">click here to renew now!</a>
                    </div></center>
